      "id": "translation",
      "html": "<h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0001-7077-0703\">Alex Antoniou</a></p>  <p>To Sextus Nonius Africanus, son of Sextus, of tribe Quirina [...] lived for 28 years. To Caecilia Zotica, Sextus Nonius Albanus made this for his excellent wife. One sestertius per person [was provided] for a banquet worthy of her.</p>  "
